{'translated_term': 'Kulmiyntiin oytih misso', 
 'translation_rationale': 'I drew inspiration from the Afar word "sehdaytiino" which means "science" or "knowledge". I combined it with "kulumintiin", a term that roughly translates to "humanities" in Afar, but has a broader meaning of "intellectual pursuits" or "higher learning". The suffix "-oytih misso" implies a field of study or an academic discipline. This translation aims to convey the idea of interdisciplinary research and analysis in the humanities domain.', 
