{'translated_term': 'Geesteswetenskaplike Datawetenskap', 
 'translation_rationale': 'I have taken the suggested term from Google Translate and modified it slightly by adding "geesteswetenskaplike" (which is more idiomatic in Afrikaans) to make it sound more natural. The term "Geesteswetenskaplike Datawetenskap" roughly translates to "Human Sciences/Study of Humanities Data Science".', 
 'alternative_translations': ['Datawetenskap met geesteswetenskapse inhoud', 'Wetenskappe van die menslikheid: data en vermoedens']}

